NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000181 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000182 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000183 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000184 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000185 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000186 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000187 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000188 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000189 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000190 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000191 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000192 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000193 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000194 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000195 "Dist::Zilla plugin and/or Pod::Weaver::Plugin. Any additional steps required"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000196 "beyond that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
